import ../../../testing/driver.dl

appearance row appearance:
    flow is horizontal
    gap is 8
    padding is 10

appearance action appearance:
    padding is 6
    background is UI ink 230 235 240
    corner radius is 4

document actions:
    region "Actions" using row appearance:
        (button "Back") wearing action appearance
        (button "Main file") wearing action appearance
    paragraph "Below" containing "Content below the actions" using no UI appearance

set instance to an instance of actions
set window to the address of instance
set count to 0
function [record document action] {a pointer to UI instance:instance}:
    globals:
        count
    execute:
        increment count
bind (the control labeled "Main file" in window) in window to (the function named "record document action $") for event 0
set view to a UI view of window sized 400 by 300 using font "regular" with the test UI driver
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set back to the UI layout labeled "Back" in (view's layout)
set main to the UI layout labeled "Main file" in (view's layout)
set below to the UI layout labeled "Below" in (view's layout)
require condition ((back's bounds' width = 44.0) and (main's bounds' width = 84.0)) reporting "Document actions did not receive intrinsic text widths and padding."
require condition ((main's bounds' y = back's bounds' y) and (main's bounds' x = (back's bounds' x + back's bounds' width + 8.0))) reporting "Horizontal document actions did not share one row."
require condition (below's bounds' y >= (back's painted bounds' y + back's bounds' height)) reporting "Document actions overlapped following content."
set point to a UI point at (main's painted bounds' x + 5.0) and (main's painted bounds' y + 5.0)
queue UI input of kind 1 key 0 at (point's x) (point's y) with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (view's hot = main) reporting "A document button did not receive pointer hover."
queue UI input of kind 2 key 1 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 2 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (count = 1) reporting "A document button did not activate through shared pointer input."
set view's width to 120
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (main's bounds' y > back's bounds' y) reporting "A horizontal document row did not wrap when its actions no longer fit."
set the "Main file" control in window enabled false
set point to a UI point at (main's painted bounds' x + 5.0) and (main's painted bounds' y + 5.0)
queue UI input of kind 1 key 0 at (point's x) (point's y) with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 2 key 1 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 2 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((count = 1) and (main's hover = 0.0)) reporting "A disabled document action remained interactive."
close the address of view
close window
print line "Document buttons share natural horizontal flow, responsive wrapping, hover and activation."
